{"id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-resolution.md","title":"归结规则、证明与反驳","display":"df-resolution — 归结规则、证明与反驳","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-resolution","aliases":["28-df-resolution"],"display":"df-resolution — 归结规则、证明与反驳","depends_on":["[[28-df-literal]]","[[28-df-clause]]","[[28-df-cnf]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"309","source_pdf_pages":"335"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-resolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-resolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolution — 归结规则、证明与反驳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"af4c08adc4c81449\" href=\"?note=af4c08adc4c81449\" title=\"28-df-clause\">28-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"309"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"335"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"af4c08adc4c81449\" href=\"?note=af4c08adc4c81449\" title=\"28-df-clause\">28-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>。子句是有限文字集，空子句为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}\">\\(C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)\">\\(\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge1\">\\(s\\ge1\\)</span>，是有限子句序列。证明长度计子句行数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)\\coloneqq(C\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cup(D\\setminus\\{\\neg x\\})\\quad(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)\\coloneqq(C\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cup(D\\setminus\\{\\neg x\\})\\quad(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResStep}(C,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\;(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D\\land E=\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ResStep}(C,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\;(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D\\land E=\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(C_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\;\\operatorname{ResStep}(C_j,C_\\ell,C_i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(C_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\;\\operatorname{ResStep}(C_j,C_\\ell,C_i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\land C_s=\\varnothing,\\qquad |\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\coloneqq s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\land C_s=\\varnothing,\\qquad |\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\coloneqq s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许输入子句按需作为行引入；空输入子句直接形成一行反驳。原书以相反单位子句终止，本地以对二者再做一步归结得到空子句终止；这只相差一步，不混淆文字数与证明行数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§15.2，印刷 p.309 / PDF p.335。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"af4c08adc4c81449","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}$ 来自 [[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]。子句是有限文字集，空子句为 $\\varnothing$。$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}$。\n$\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)$，$s\\ge1$，是有限子句序列。证明长度计子句行数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"af4c08adc4c81449","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}$ 来自 [[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]。子句是有限文字集，空子句为 $\\varnothing$。$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}$。\n$\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)$，$s\\ge1$，是有限子句序列。证明长度计子句行数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}$ 来自 [[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-cnf]]。子句是有限文字集，空子句为 $\\varnothing$。$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}$。\n$\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)$，$s\\ge1$，是有限子句序列。证明长度计子句行数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Lit},\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"C,D,E\\in\\mathrm{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)\\coloneqq(C\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cup(D\\setminus\\{\\neg x\\})\\quad(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResStep}(C,D,E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\;(x\\in C\\land\\neg x\\in D\\land E=\\operatorname{Res}_x(C,D)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;(C_i\\in F\\lor\\exists j,\\ell\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}\\;\\operatorname{ResStep}(C_j,C_\\ell,C_i)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ResProof}(F,\\pi)\\land C_s=\\varnothing,\\qquad |\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\coloneqq s.","display":true}],"bytes":1802,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第15章：证明复杂性：[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]、[[28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp]]、[[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness]]、[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]、[[28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound]]。"},{"id":"46778a95d3c9618d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N\\in\\mathbb N$，$N\\ge2$；$F=\\mathrm{PHP}_{N,N-1}$ 来自 [[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]。$\\operatorname{ResRef},|\\pi|_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。"},{"id":"1975358c159b50db","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 见 [[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]。固定三列两两互异且列间不交的变量 $(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}$；$\\neg v$ 为否定文字。"},{"id":"525bdca973e42a63","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha$ 来自 [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]；$\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。"}],"outgoing":["f3bec18052244e5d","af4c08adc4c81449","c8f19b1793fdfb6a"]}